{"Per-topic unsubscribe endpoint requires login due to ensure_logged_in before_filter, preventing logged-out email recipients from using the unsubscribe link": 0.6474969983100891, "GET unsubscribe endpoint mutates topic notification state without CSRF protection, allowing third-party sites to silently change user subscription state": 0.9283853769302368, "Per-topic email unsubscribe URL is only wired into notification mail path while shared unsubscribe_link copy affects all emails, causing inconsistent templating across email variants": 0.6827098727226257, "Per-topic unsubscribe URL is injected into emails without validation or escaping, creating potential HTML/link injection vector in outgoing mail if URL source can be influenced": 0.2927338778972626, "Email template renders stopNotificiationsText with triple mustaches and populates title from model.fancyTitle without escaping, allowing crafted topic titles to break email markup": 0.1896633803844452, "Email unsubscribe copy implies full unsubscribe from all topic mail but controller only toggles between regular and muted notification levels, creating misleading user expectations": 0.6252629160881042}